'''Omegle VR''' is a social [[Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Game worlds|game world]] published by {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_817014e0-1065-4a30-9623-984370ce28a9|Puppet~}}. Players connect assigned rooms to talk over a webcam.<ref name="patreon-about">[https://www.patreon.com/puppetvr/about Puppet] on ''Patreon''. Retrieved {{Date|2026-09-14}}.</ref> A PC-only listing, [[#Omegle VR - PC Onlyǃ|Omegle VR - PC Onlyǃ]], is the same map.

== Layout ==

Players spawn during Assigning room ... A house sits outside the rooms. It has pickable props, chairs, and a Poster Board. A group board reads For updates, join the group, with a Join Group control. The group is {{Group link|grp_c2e95ae1-b746-4f96-b851-2eb02c075d51|Puppet's Worlds}}.

A supporter hallway board lists How-to in 3 steps: Become a supporter, Connect Discord, and Set VRChat name. The board points to #how-to-get-rewards. Patreon and Ko-fi unlock borders. VRChat Store is listed as the other option.

[[File:Omegle_VR_world_icon_-_discord_command.png|frameless|alt=Posted /change_vrchat_name command]]

Anti-Cheat meassures are in place to prevent listening to other players' conversations.

== Gameplay ==

Start Search... looks for another room. Two people are needed. You have actions like Invite, Next, Return, and Clear.

The room owner can Invite extra players. An Extra Players control lists extra players in the room.

