== World store ==

The cross-platform listing is enrolled in the [[Special:MyLanguage/Creator Economy|Creator Economy]]. The world store sells Beggar's Friend for {{Credits|100}}. The listing is a donation and unlocks nothing.

The Puppet's Worlds group store sells Cool Individual, Awesome Individual, and Amazing Individual (1-month). Those listings unlock room skins, borders, Flag Skin, and a name on the supporter board in this world. They also cover [[Special:MyLanguage/Community:A Simple Fishing World|A Simple Fishing World]], [[Special:MyLanguage/Community:Prompt or Die|Prompt or Die]], and [[Special:MyLanguage/Community:Ultimate Smash Or Pass|Ultimate Smash Or Pass]].

